    "airshower.html": {
      "title": "Air Shower",
      "description": "We supply best quality with high performance Air Shower, which is widely appreciated for its superior quality and performance. The Air Shower is basically used to supply class 100 HEPA filtered air at maximum velocity to remove impurities from the clean room. Based on their high efficiency and easy functioning",
